    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-wrap">
        <div>
          <span class="badge">
            <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--primary)"></span>
            Live player count: 900k+
          </span>
          <h1>Tactical, competitive, unforgettable. Your CS:GO HQ.</h1>
          <p>Stay on top of the meta with curated news, weapon stats, map callouts, and tips from seasoned players. Join events, find teammates, and level up your game.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#download">Download & Play</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="#guides">View Pro Guides</a>
          </div>
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="pill">Tick 64/128 Ready</span>
            <span class="pill">Beginner Friendly</span>
            <span class="pill">Community Verified</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-media" role="img" aria-label="Stylized CS:GO crosshair and backdrop">
            <div class="crosshair" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="video-bar">
            <span class="tag">Featured: Mirage Mid Control</span>
            <span class="tag">Utility lineup</span>
            <span class="tag">Eco strats</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="news">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Latest News</h2>
          <a href="#" class="pill">All updates →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Patch Notes: Balance tweaks + QoL</h3>
              <p>UMP and Galil adjustments, improved demo playback, and fixes for common matchmaking issues.</p>
              <p class="note">3 hours ago • by Admin</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Community Spotlight: Utility Workshop</h3>
              <p>Top 20 smoke and flash lineups submitted by the community—organized by map and site.</p>
              <p class="note">1 day ago • by Staff</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Esports: Major Qualifiers Recap</h3>
              <p>Surprise upsets and breakout stars as teams lock in their slots for the next Major.</p>
              <p class="note">2 days ago • by Esports Desk</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="maps">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Popular Maps</h2>
          <a href="#" class="pill">Open callouts pack →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid quad">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Mirage</h3>
              <p>Mid control is king. Smokes for Window, Connector, and Top Cat to split A/B.</p>
              <div class="row" style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <span class="tag">PUG Friendly</span>
                <span class="tag">Default-heavy</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Inferno</h3>
              <p>Banana utility wins rounds. Molotov Sandbags and Smoke Coffins on B executes.</p>
              <div class="row" style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <span class="tag">Utility Mastery</span>
                <span class="tag">Late-Round</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Dust II</h3>
              <p>Classic picks: Long fights and Mid to B splits; practice your A site smokes.</p>
              <div class="row" style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <span class="tag">Aim Heavy</span>
                <span class="tag">AWP Lines</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Nuke</h3>
              <p>Verticality and rotations. A well-timed vent drop can flip the round.</p>
              <div class="row" style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <span class="tag">Rotations</span>
                <span class="tag">Set Pieces</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="weapons">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Weapons & Meta</h2>
          <a href="#" class="pill">Full armory →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid cards">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Rifles</h3>
              <div class="weapon">
                <img alt="AK-47 silhouette" src="" />
                <div style="flex:1">
                  <strong>AK-47</strong>
                  <div class="note">One-tap potential; excels on T-side.</div>
                  <div class="stat" aria-label="Damage 90%">
                    <span style="width:90%"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="weapon">
                <img alt="M4A1-S silhouette" src="" />
                <div style="flex:1">
                  <strong>M4A1-S</strong>
                  <div class="note">Silent accuracy; ammo management matters.</div>
                  <div class="stat" aria-label="Damage 72%">
                    <span style="width:72%"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Snipers</h3>
              <div class="weapon">
                <img alt="AWP silhouette" src="" />
                <div style="flex:1">
                  <strong>AWP</strong>
                  <div class="note">Hold angles; high impact but costly.</div>
                  <div class="stat" aria-label="Impact 95%">
                    <span style="width:95%"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="weapon">
                <img alt="SSG 08 silhouette" src="" />
                <div style="flex:1">
                  <strong>SSG 08</strong>
                  <div class="note">Budget picks; mobility and timing.</div>
                  <div class="stat" aria-label="Impact 65%">
                    <span style="width:65%"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="content">
              <h3>Utility</h3>
              <div class="weapon">
                <img alt="HE grenade icon" src="" />
                <div style="flex:1">
                  <strong>HE Grenade</strong>
                  <div class="note">Chip damage; pair with mollies for trap plays.</div>
                  <div class="stat" aria-label="Value 60%">
                    <span style="width:60%"></span>
                  </div>
